WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.250
Choose Add Catalog Item.

00:02.250 --> 00:05.750
For this planter, choose 3D Printing.

00:05.750 --> 00:08.750
Copper outlines mark required fields.

00:08.750 --> 00:12.000
Keep “I print / make it.”

00:12.000 --> 00:15.750
For item type, keep “3D Printed Item.”

00:15.750 --> 00:24.500
Name the planter “4-inch Plant Pot – Sage.” We’ll give it a manual selling price.

00:24.500 --> 00:29.750
Enter fourteen dollars, then choose Save Item.

00:29.750 --> 00:32.750
The new planter appears in your Catalog.

